 "title": "Image 030: “Bøsse, beholdt dit Skud lige saa reent som Jomfru Maria beholdt sin Jomfrudom”",
 "caption": "The first charm of the held-out image 030 (Det Kgl. Bibliotek, Dansk Folkemindesamling, DFS 1997/020), decoded sign by sign with the frozen key. The signs are those of the frozen transcription, with three words corrected on the full-size image at the integration (beholdt twice, the final a of Maria).",
 "unit": "signs",
